{"text":"Believers hymn for the Republic. Twelve score and three years ago, to be exact, our founders dared to declare the world's most revolutionary act a pact, sworn for liberty and equality out of many, was born one people, a teaming nation made of nations at its very foundation of dream, for life, liberty, and the pursuit of happiness. Together, sorry, together today, we gather so a founder's words should not go diminished, but we also gather so that the work does not go unfinished. It is not just a declaration of independence, but the everyday declarations of its descendants that make a people equal. It is our rights and our role to remember those words scratched on a scroll and to live them in order to heal our nation whole. We roll up our sleeves, we believe in the dream and these American stories in the glory of our struggle, because from our struggle comes our native strength, for the lengths we fight, for what is right is the fullest measure of our country's might.","words":[{"text":"Believers","start":0.0,"end":1.12},{"text":"hymn","start":1.12,"end":1.7},{"text":"for","start":1.7,"end":2.0},{"text":"the","start":2.0,"end":2.14},{"text":"Republic","start":2.14,"end":2.66,"punct":"."},{"text":"Twelve","start":3.64,"end":4.2},{"text":"score","start":4.2,"end":4.84},{"text":"and","start":4.84,"end":5.46},{"text":"three","start":5.46,"end":5.76},{"text":"years","start":5.76,"end":6.12},{"text":"ago","start":6.12,"end":6.54,"punct":","},{"text":"to","start":6.96,"end":6.98},{"text":"be","start":6.98,"end":7.18},{"text":"exact","start":7.18,"end":7.8,"punct":","},{"text":"our","start":8.24,"end":8.28},{"text":"founders","start":8.28,"end":8.6},{"text":"dared","start":8.6,"end":9.0},{"text":"to","start":9.0,"end":9.28},{"text":"declare","start":9.28,"end":9.66},{"text":"the","start":9.66,"end":9.94},{"text":"world's","start":9.94,"end":10.4},{"text":"most","start":10.4,"end":10.6},{"text":"revolutionary","start":10.6,"end":11.34},{"text":"act","start":11.34,"end